---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about rep.et — an independent civic tool for exploring Ethiopia's House of Peoples' Representatives (HOPR), its 471 elected members of parliament, and constituency data."
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
    <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "About" }]} />

    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-6">About rep.et</h1>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-start">
      <div class="bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">What is HOPR?</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          The House of Peoples' Representatives (HOPR) is the highest
          legislative body in the country, with members directly elected by the
          people from 547 constituencies across Ethiopia's regions.
          Representatives are responsible for enacting legislation, approving
          the federal budget, and overseeing the executive branch.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">What This Site Does</h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          rep.et helps citizens find their elected representative in the House
          of Peoples' Representatives. You can use your device's location to
          find the nearest constituency, search by name or location, or browse
          representatives by region and party. The site covers the 471
          constituency results from the 6th National Election.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Data Source</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            The data presented on this site was collected from the official 6th
            National Election results published by the <a
              href="https://nebe.org.et/"
              class="text-link hover:underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >National Election Board of Ethiopia (NEBE)</a
            >.
          </p>
          <p>
            The geographic coordinates for each constituency were geocoded from
            constituency names. These are approximate point locations, not
            official boundary data. As a result, the "find your representative"
            feature uses a nearest-point approximation and may not be perfectly
            accurate at constituency borders. The approximate coordinates were
            mapped to locations using <a
              href="https://gebeta.app"
              class="text-link hover:underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer">Gebeta Maps</a
            >.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-callout-bg border border-callout-border rounded-lg p-6">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-primary">Disclaimer</h2>
        <div class="space-y-3 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            This is an independent, unofficial project. It is not affiliated
            with or endorsed by the Ethiopian government, the <a
              href="https://nebe.org.et/"
              class="text-link hover:underline"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              >National Election Board of Ethiopia (NEBE)</a
            >, or any political party.
          </p>
          <p>
            This is an open-source civic experiment, not an official government
            service. The data is provided as-is for informational purposes.
            While we strive for accuracy, we cannot guarantee that all
            information is complete or error-free.
          </p>
          <p>
            The geolocation feature provides an approximation based on
            nearest-point distance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
